# Ep3 — custom slash commands (REAL claude)
Output channels/claude-tricks/assets/ep03/term_commands.mp4
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1350
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Shell "bash"

Hide
Type "cd ~/demo-project && mkdir -p .claude/commands && rm -f .claude/commands/rules.md && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "mkdir -p .claude/commands"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "cat > .claude/commands/rules.md << 'DONE'"
Enter
Type "List every rule from our CLAUDE.md"
Enter
Type "as a short checklist with checkboxes."
Enter
Type "DONE"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "clear && claude"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "/rules"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 20s
